---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="三维旋转的顺序为什么重要？ — J.H. Lab" description="亲手操作三维旋转，比较先绕 X 轴再绕 Y 轴与反过来的结果。">
 <article id="rotation-lab" class="rotation-lab wrap">
  <header class="lab-head" id="top">
   <p class="eyebrow">J.H. LAB / EXPERIMENT 001</p>
   <a class="back-link" href="/brief/"><span data-locale="zh">← 返回每日发现</span><span data-locale="en">← Back to Daily Brief</span></a>
   <h1><span data-locale="zh">先转 X，再转 Y。<br/>结果会一样吗？</span><span data-locale="en">Rotate X, then Y.<br/>Does order matter?</span></h1>
   <p class="lead"><span data-locale="zh">三维旋转不满足交换律。不要先相信这句话——试着自己交换操作顺序。</span><span data-locale="en">3D rotations do not generally commute. Don't take our word for it — swap the order and see.</span></p>
  </header>
  <section class="control-area" aria-labelledby="control-title">
   <div class="section-line"><h2 id="control-title"><span data-locale="zh">设置两个旋转</span><span data-locale="en">Set two rotations</span></h2><button id="rotation-reset" type="button"><span data-locale="zh">重置实验</span><span data-locale="en">Reset</span> ↺</button></div>
   <div class="sliders">
    <div class="slider-block"><label for="angle-x"><span data-locale="zh">绕 X 轴</span><span data-locale="en">Around X axis</span></label><output id="angle-x-value" for="angle-x">90°</output><input type="range" min="0" max="180" step="15" value="90" id="angle-x" aria-label="X axis angle" /></div>
    <div class="slider-block"><label for="angle-y"><span data-locale="zh">绕 Y 轴</span><span data-locale="en">Around Y axis</span></label><output id="angle-y-value" for="angle-y">90°</output><input type="range" min="0" max="180" step="15" value="90" id="angle-y" aria-label="Y axis angle" /></div>
   </div>
   <div class="rotation-presets" role="group" aria-label="示例角度 / Example angles">
    <span><span data-locale="zh">试一试：</span><span data-locale="en">Try:</span></span>
    <button type="button" data-rotation-preset="different"><span data-locale="zh">90° + 90° · 结果不同</span><span data-locale="en">90° + 90° · Different</span></button>
    <button type="button" data-rotation-preset="same"><span data-locale="zh">0° + 90° · 特殊重合</span><span data-locale="en">0° + 90° · Special case</span></button>
   </div>
  </section>
  <section class="steps" aria-labelledby="steps-title">
   <div class="section-line"><h2 id="steps-title"><span data-locale="zh">分步观察</span><span data-locale="en">Walk through the rotation</span></h2></div>
   <div class="step-buttons" role="group" aria-label="旋转步骤 / Rotation stages">
    <button type="button" data-rotation-step="0" aria-pressed="false"><span data-locale="zh">① 初始</span><span data-locale="en">① Start</span></button>
    <button type="button" data-rotation-step="1" aria-pressed="false"><span data-locale="zh">② 第一次旋转</span><span data-locale="en">② First rotation</span></button>
    <button type="button" data-rotation-step="2" aria-pressed="true"><span data-locale="zh">③ 完成旋转</span><span data-locale="en">③ Both rotations</span></button>
   </div>
   <div class="playback-controls" role="group" aria-label="连续旋转演示 / Rotation playback">
    <button id="rotation-replay" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span> <span data-locale="zh">播放两次旋转</span><span data-locale="en">Play both rotations</span></button>
    <button id="rotation-stop" type="button" hidden><span aria-hidden="true">■</span> <span data-locale="zh">停止演示</span><span data-locale="en">Stop animation</span></button>
   </div>
   <p id="rotation-step-explanation" class="step-explanation" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span data-locale="zh">第二步：左侧再绕 Y 轴，右侧再绕 X 轴。</span><span data-locale="en">Step 2: left adds Y, right adds X.</span></p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="comparison-title">
   <div class="section-line"><h2 id="comparison-title"><span data-locale="zh">交换顺序，观察差别</span><span data-locale="en">Swap the order</span></h2><div class="camera-buttons"><button id="rotation-camera-left" type="button" aria-label="向左转动观察视角">↶</button><button id="rotation-camera-right" type="button" aria-label="向右转动观察视角">↷</button></div></div>
   <div class="compare-grid">
    <section class="outcome" aria-labelledby="order-xy-title">
     <div class="outcome-header"><span class="number">01</span><h3 id="order-xy-title"><span data-locale="zh">先 X，后 Y</span><span data-locale="en">X first, then Y</span></h3></div>
     <canvas id="rotation-xy" width="480" height="340" role="img" aria-label="先绕X轴后绕Y轴旋转后的立方体，可拖动改变观察角度"><span data-locale="zh">浏览器无法显示三维画布，请查看下方坐标结果。</span><span data-locale="en">Canvas unavailable; read the coordinates below.</span></canvas>
     <p class="coordinates"><span data-locale="zh">初始正面 Z 轴指向</span><span data-locale="en">Resulting front Z vector</span> <strong id="rotation-xy-vector">(0.00, -1.00, 0.00)</strong></p>
    </section>
    <section class="outcome" aria-labelledby="order-yx-title">
     <div class="outcome-header"><span class="number">02</span><h3 id="order-yx-title"><span data-locale="zh">先 Y，后 X</span><span data-locale="en">Y first, then X</span></h3></div>
     <canvas id="rotation-yx" width="480" height="340" role="img" aria-label="先绕Y轴后绕X轴旋转后的立方体，可拖动改变观察角度"><span data-locale="zh">浏览器无法显示三维画布，请查看下方坐标结果。</span><span data-locale="en">Canvas unavailable; read the coordinates below.</span></canvas>
     <p class="coordinates"><span data-locale="zh">初始正面 Z 轴指向</span><span data-locale="en">Resulting front Z vector</span> <strong id="rotation-yx-vector">(1.00, 0.00, 0.00)</strong></p>
    </section>
   </div>
   <button id="rotation-overlay-toggle" type="button" class="overlay-toggle" aria-controls="rotation-overlay-panel" aria-expanded="false"><span data-locale="zh">叠影对比两种姿态</span><span data-locale="en">Overlay both orientations</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
   <div id="rotation-overlay-panel" class="overlay-panel" hidden>
    <p class="overlay-legend"><span class="legend-blue"><span data-locale="zh">蓝 A：先 X 后 Y</span><span data-locale="en">Blue A: X then Y</span></span><span class="legend-orange"><span data-locale="zh">橙 B：先 Y 后 X</span><span data-locale="en">Orange B: Y then X</span></span></p>
    <canvas id="rotation-overlay" width="720" height="380" role="img" aria-label="蓝色 A 与橙色 B 的旋转坐标轴对比：Z 为实线，X 为虚线；外框仅用于辅助观察"></canvas>
    <p class="overlay-caption"><span data-locale="zh">正方体具有旋转对称性，因此外轮廓重合也可能是不同姿态。请比较蓝 A、橙 B 的实线 Z 轴与虚线 X 轴方向：两组方向一致，最终姿态才一致。</span><span data-locale="en">A cube is symmetric: overlapping outlines can still represent different orientations. Compare solid Z and dashed X axes for blue A versus orange B to determine whether the orientations actually agree.</span></p>
   </div>
   <p class="gesture-hint"><span data-locale="zh">旋转操作围绕固定的世界 X、Y 轴；面上的彩色 X／Y／Z 标记跟着立方体运动。拖动只改变观察视角，不会改变实验结果。</span><span data-locale="en">Operations rotate around fixed world X and Y axes. Colored X/Y/Z stickers move with the cube. Dragging changes only the shared camera, not the experiment.</span></p>
  </section>
  <section class="result" aria-labelledby="result-title">
   <p class="eyebrow">WHAT YOU DISCOVER</p>
   <h2 id="result-title"><span data-locale="zh">为什么结果不同？</span><span data-locale="en">Why are they different?</span></h2>
   <p class="math-line">R<sub>Y</sub>(θ<sub>Y</sub>) R<sub>X</sub>(θ<sub>X</sub>) <span aria-label="通常不等于">≠</span> R<sub>X</sub>(θ<sub>X</sub>) R<sub>Y</sub>(θ<sub>Y</sub>)</p>
   <div class="result-metric"><span data-locale="zh">当前两种姿态的矩阵差距（Frobenius 范数）</span><span data-locale="en">Current orientation difference (Frobenius norm)</span><output id="rotation-difference" aria-live="polite">2.45</output></div>
   <p class="metric-note"><span data-locale="zh">数值为 0 表示两种最终姿态完全相同；它不是角度差。</span><span data-locale="en">Zero means the final orientations agree; this is not an angle in degrees.</span></p>
   <p id="rotation-note" role="status" aria-live="polite">交换旋转顺序会改变空间姿态。比较两个立方体的正面标记。</p>
   <p class="explainer"><span data-locale="zh">三维旋转属于旋转群 SO(3)。矩阵作用在列向量上，右侧的操作先执行，因此「先 X 后 Y」对应 RY · RX。旋转的先后顺序通常不可交换；某些特殊角度（如其中一个为 0°）可能得到相同结果。</span><span data-locale="en">Three-dimensional rotations form SO(3). With column vectors, the rightmost matrix acts first: X then Y means RY · RX. Order generally matters, although special cases (such as a zero angle) can coincide.</span></p>
  </section>
  <footer class="lab-footer"><a href="/brief/"><span data-locale="zh">← 回到日常阅读</span><span data-locale="en">← Return to reading</span></a><span>J.H. LAB / EXPERIMENT 001</span></footer>
 </article>
</BaseLayout>
<script>
 import "../../../lib/rotation-lab";
</script>
<style>
 .rotation-lab{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(22px,5vw,65px) 0 90px}
 .lab-head{margin:0 0 clamp(22px,3vw,44px)}
 .lab-head .eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em}
 .back-link{display:inline-block;margin:9px 0 24px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-decoration:none}
 h1{font-size:clamp(34px,5.6vw,66px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:0 0 18px}
 .lead{max-width:700px;font-size:clamp(15px,1.8vw,21px);line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted);margin:0}
 .control-area{padding:22px 0 32px;border-top:1px solid var(--stroke)}
 .section-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px;margin-bottom:16px}
 .section-line h2{font-size:clamp(17px,2.6vw,24px);margin:0}
 button{min-height:44px;cursor:pointer;background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:30px;padding:9px 14px;color:var(--fg);font:inherit;font-size:13px}
 button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}
 .sliders{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
 .slider-block{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:12px;background:var(--card);padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:16px}
 .slider-block label{font-weight:600}.slider-block output{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--accent)}
 .slider-block input{grid-column:1/-1;width:100%;accent-color:var(--accent);min-height:30px}
 .camera-buttons{display:flex;gap:7px}.camera-buttons button{min-width:44px;font-size:21px;padding:3px 10px}
 .compare-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
 .outcome{min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--card)}
 .outcome-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:17px 20px 0}
 .outcome-header .number{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
 .outcome h3{font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,21px);margin:0}
 .outcome canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(215px,31vw,340px);touch-action:none;cursor:grab;user-select:none}
 .outcome canvas:active{cursor:grabbing}
 .coordinates{border-top:1px solid var(--stroke);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:4px 12px;padding:13px 20px;margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
 .coordinates strong{color:var(--fg);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
 .gesture-hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:14px 0 36px}
 .rotation-presets{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-top:13px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
 .rotation-presets button{padding:6px 11px;min-height:38px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px}
 .steps{padding:0 0 25px}
 .step-buttons{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}
 .step-buttons button{border-radius:10px;padding:12px 8px;font-weight:600;min-width:0;white-space:normal;line-height:1.35}
 .step-buttons button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg);border-color:var(--fg)}
 .playback-controls{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}
 .playback-controls button{border-radius:11px;font-weight:600;padding:8px 14px}
 .playback-controls button[hidden]{display:none!important}
 .playback-controls #rotation-replay{background:var(--fg);border-color:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
 .playback-controls #rotation-replay[aria-disabled="true"]{opacity:.6;cursor:default}
  .step-explanation{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);min-height:1.6em;margin:12px 0 0}
 .overlay-toggle{display:block;width:100%;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;margin:16px 0}
 .overlay-toggle[aria-expanded="true"]{border-color:var(--accent)}
 .overlay-panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}
 .overlay-panel[hidden]{display:none!important}
 .overlay-panel canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(240px,36vw,380px)}
 .overlay-legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 22px;margin:0;padding:15px 18px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:600}
 .legend-blue{color:#236ca9}.legend-orange{color:#b8682d}
 .overlay-caption{padding:0 18px 16px;margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.7}
 .result{border-top:1px solid var(--stroke);padding-top:30px;max-width:820px}
 .result h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,44px);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:3px 0 18px}
 .result .eyebrow{font-size:11px}.math-line{font-size:clamp(16px,2.5vw,25px);margin:0 0 25px;white-space:normal;line-height:1.6}
 .result-metric{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:17px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--stroke);border-bottom:1px solid var(--stroke)}
 .result-metric output{font-size:30px;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
 .metric-note{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}
 .result #rotation-note{font-weight:600;line-height:1.7}.explainer{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.85;font-size:14px}
 .lab-footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;border-top:1px solid var(--stroke);padding-top:25px;margin-top:50px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
 .lab-footer a{color:var(--fg);text-decoration:none}
 @media(max-width:760px){.rotation-lab{width:calc(100% - 28px);padding-top:18px}.sliders,.compare-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.compare-grid{gap:11px}.slider-block{padding:13px 16px}.outcome canvas{height:245px}.control-area{padding-top:15px}.lab-head{margin-bottom:35px}.outcome-header{padding:13px 15px 0}.coordinates{padding:12px 15px}.result-metric{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.step-buttons{gap:6px}.step-buttons button{font-size:11px;padding:10px 3px}.overlay-panel canvas{height:260px}.lab-footer{font-size:11px}}
 @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}
</style>
